            <description><![CDATA[<h2>RestinPID 3.6</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Quick hide:</b> a new eye-slash button on each app, next to Restart and Force Quit, takes the app out of the list. Choose 15 minutes, 1 hour, 4 hours, until tomorrow, until the app restarts, or always. The same choices are in the right-click menu.</li>
<li>Hidden apps are also left out of Restart All and Force Quit All.</li>
<li><b>Hidden for now:</b> Settings → Excluded lists temporarily hidden apps, shows when each one comes back, and has a Show button to bring it back right away.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
